WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.071 --> 00:00:02.320
- 'Cause you're also in another big movie,

00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:03.340
Marvel's "The Eternals".

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:04.260
You were talking about
that at the beginning

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:06.410
and are you scared of
accidentally spoiling it?

00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:07.850
'Cause I feel like they're
like pretty hardcore

00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:08.910
on people, right?

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:11.130
- Well, there are five
Marvel people standing

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:12.080
behind my computer right now.

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:14.330
(laughing)

00:00:15.319 --> 00:00:18.029
You know what, it was
such an amazing time.

00:00:18.029 --> 00:00:20.590
There was a part of my
life where I never thought

00:00:20.590 --> 00:00:23.390
that I would ever get to see
myself reflected back to me.

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:26.020
And most of the parts that I've played,

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:28.340
to be the quirky scientist
and Godzilla, you know,

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:29.800
and then to be a superhero,

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:31.110
I just never thought it would happen.

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:33.770
And I am incredibly, incredibly grateful

00:00:33.770 --> 00:00:36.370
to Marvel for allowing
me to play a character

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:38.470
that reflects me back to me.

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:40.420
And being able to work with Chloe Zhao

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:43.410
who is blowing up, her eye is one

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:45.410
of the most amazing eyes I've ever seen.

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.820
Big ups to her on
"Nomadland" and you know,

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:49.130
the work she's doing.

00:00:49.130 --> 00:00:51.960
And I just am really excited for the world

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:54.090
to see exactly where
we're taking this universe

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:56.900
'cause it's unlike anything
you've ever experienced or seen.

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:59.830
And it's a beautiful thing to
see representation up there.

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:01.040
So I'm glad to be a part of it.

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:04.410
- Absolutely and I am a
total nerd for Marvel.

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:06.307
Like I, I'm like,

00:01:06.307 --> 00:01:07.960
"Oh yeah, my kids and I
are gonna watch this."

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:10.860
My kids will like jet like
10 minutes in the movie

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:13.020
and I am like.
(audience laughing)

00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:13.853
- What's your go-to?

00:01:13.853 --> 00:01:15.990
Who's your go-to, who's
your go-to Marvel person?

00:01:15.990 --> 00:01:19.480
- Dr Strange is currently my favorite.

00:01:19.480 --> 00:01:20.340
- Okay then.

00:01:20.340 --> 00:01:22.710
All right.
- I know, I like Dr Strange.

00:01:22.710 --> 00:01:23.543
You know why?

00:01:23.543 --> 00:01:24.376
I like his power.

00:01:24.376 --> 00:01:26.410
I think his power is really rad.

00:01:26.410 --> 00:01:27.270
That's the thing.

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:29.140
- Wait until you see my powers.

00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:30.880
They're, I don't wanna give nothing away

00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:32.630
'cause like I said, Marvel's
standing right here,

00:01:32.630 --> 00:01:34.160
but--
(audience laughing)

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:35.786
- Okay, okay, I'm excited.
- Mine are pretty dope.

00:01:35.786 --> 00:01:38.080
I wanna see my cosplay
from you at one point.

00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:39.190
I want you--
- Okay, okay.

00:01:39.190 --> 00:01:40.023
You better bring it.

00:01:40.023 --> 00:01:41.159
You better bring your A game.

00:01:41.159 --> 00:01:43.027
(laughing)
You're fricken powers.

00:01:43.027 --> 00:01:44.279
- It's already brought, Kelly Clarkson.

00:01:44.279 --> 00:01:45.940
It's already brought.

00:01:45.940 --> 00:01:47.480
- I'm like, you better not suck.

00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:48.313
Just kidding.

00:01:48.313 --> 00:01:49.477
(laughing)
Just kidding.

